<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Colep cleared to raise capital.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Colep cleared to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese metal packaging business Colep Portugal-Embalagens, Produtos, Enchimentos e Equipamentos has been authorised to raise capital by up to 15 billion escudos, the official Lisbon bourse bulletin said.</p>
<p>&quot;The board is authorised to raise capital by up to 15 billion escudos,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>After its flotation on Lisbon bourse in March, Colep raised its capital by 6.5 billion escudos to 11.6 billion.</p>
</text>
